{%- comment -%}
Soilboy

"SP 0N. Plant Name" caption used under Installation body images and the
testimonial image. The number is generated here from a page-wide sequence
passed in by the caller (see sections/installation-body.liquid), not stored
on the entry, so credits stay correct if blocks are reordered.

Variables:
- credit: plant_credit metaobject entry (plant_name)
- index: Integer. Page-wide sequence number, 1-based. Renders nothing if 0
  or the credit/plant name is blank.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign plant_name = credit.plant_name.value
-%}
{% if credit != blank and index > 0 and plant_name != blank %}
  {% liquid
    assign index_padded = index
    if index < 10
      assign index_padded = '0' | append: index
    endif
  %}
  <div class="flex colgap-16 p4 c-label ipc-caption">
    <span class="ipc-caption-label">SP {{ index_padded }}.</span>
    <span>{{ plant_name }}</span>
  </div>
{% endif %}
